":"每次出牌有50%概率获得一张【献策】，每回合第一次使用【献策】时获得一点行动AP并恢复自身400点MP。","en":"50% chance to gain an 【Offer Counsel】 card whenever playing a card. The first use of 【Offer Counsel】 each turn grants 1 AP and recovers 400 MP."}}],"debateSouls":[{"id":"1001205","name":{"zh":"兴会神到","en":"Divine Inspiration"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"每回合开始时恢复80点形势值和10%脑力值。","en":"Recover 80 Momentum and 10% Mental Energy at the start of each turn."}}],"soulPoints":{"war":4400,"battle":1500,"debate":6500},"equipment":[{"id":"WP1007302","name":{"zh":"风雅竹卷","en":"Elegant Bamboo Scroll"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"小巧高贵的竹简，颇受南方文人墨客的欢迎。","en":"A compact, elegant bamboo slip favored by southern scholars and literati."},"atkVal":"7","hp":"330","mp":"470","price":"7800","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1015805","name":{"zh":"锦绣挂衣","en":"Embroidered Tunic"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"采用了普通的面料并进行了纹饰处理的挂衣，衣服的边缘处也添加了简单的纹饰。","en":"A coat-style garment made of ordinary fabric and adorned with patterns, with simple decorative trim also added along the edges."},"defenceVal":"3","hp":"400","price":"2800","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1024505","name":{"zh":"立巾帻","en":"Upright Kerchief"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"与屋山帻一样，为最常见的巾帻，多为地方小官、传令官佩戴。","en":"Like the ridged cap, one of the most common headcloths, typically worn by minor officials and heralds."},"defenceVal":"5","mp":"1000","price":"5500","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10117","code":"0"}]},"otherRelationship":{"label":{"zh":"其他关系","en":"Other relationships"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10096","code":"6"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI111915","name":{"zh":"襄阳庞氏","en":"The Pang clan of Xiangyang"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自姬姓，周文王子毕公高之后，封于庞，后裔以邑为氏。襄阳庞氏为荆州顶级名门，与蔡、蒯、黄、习、杨并称襄阳六大豪族。庞德公居岘山之南，躬耕不仕，为汉末名士领袖。庞统与诸葛亮齐名，为刘备取蜀第一谋士。家族通过联姻与荆襄士族网络深度绑定，影响力横跨魏蜀两国。","en":"Originating from the Ji surname, descendants of Duke Gao of Bi, son of King Wen of Zhou. He was enfeoffed in Pang, and his descendants took the fief as their surname. The Pang clan of Xiangyang was a premier illustrious lineage in Jing Province, ranked alongside the Cai, Kuai, Huang, Xi, and Yang as one of the Six Great Clans of Xiangyang. Lord Pang De lived South of Mount Xian, tilling the fields and refusing government service, becoming a leading luminary of the late Han era. Pang Tong shared equal renown with Zhuge Liang and served as Liu Bei's foremost strategist in the conquest of Shu. Through intermarriage, the Family was deeply tied to the gentry network of Jingxiang, with its influence spanning across both Wei and Shu."},"talent":{"military":"3","commerce":"2","politics":"6"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[67,52,81,76,70,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[67,52,81,76,70,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[67,52,81,76,70,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name