":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,52,81,76,70,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,52,81,76,70,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,52,81,76,70,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007302","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国官臣，庞统之子，官至涪陵太守。庞宏继承了父亲的才华，性格刚毅、为人直率、不畏权威，喜好评品人物，常常蔑视尚书令陈袛。延熙十三年，涪陵徐巨叛乱平定后，庞宏临危受命，宣抚百姓、严绳豪右、吏治廉明，甚得民心。延熙十七年夏，出巡汉复县，处理民案，返程于乌江洪渡镇遇暴风覆舟，因公殉职。无追谥、无厚葬，身后凄凉。","tc":"蜀國官臣，龐統之子，官至涪陵太守。龐宏繼承了父親的才華，性格剛毅、為人直率、不畏權威，喜好評品人物，常常蔑視尚書令陳袛。延熙十三年，涪陵徐巨叛亂平定后，龐宏臨危受命，宣撫百姓、嚴繩豪右、吏治廉明，甚得民心。延熙十七年夏，出巡漢復縣，處理民案，返程于烏江洪渡鎮遇暴風覆舟，因公殉職。無追謚、無厚葬，身后凄涼。","en":"An official of Shu and the son of Pang Tong, who served as Governor of Fuling. Pang Hong inherited his father's talent, being resolute in character, forthright, and unafraid of authority. Fond of appraising figures of his time, he frequently showed contempt for Secretary General Chen Zhi. In 250, after the rebellion of Xu Ju in Fuling was quelled, Pang Hong took office in a time of crisis. He comforted the common people, strictly curbed the powerful clans, and governed with integrity, winning great popularity. In the summer of 254, while inspecting Hanfu County to resolve civil cases, his boat capsized in a storm at Hongdu Town on the Wu River on his return journey, and he died in the line of duty. Granted neither a posthumous title nor an elaborate burial, he met a bleak and desolate end.","jp":"蜀の臣で、龐統の子。官位は涪陵太守に至った。龐宏は父の才気を受け継ぎ、性格は剛毅で実直、権威を恐れず人物を批評することを好み、尚書令の陳祗をしばしば軽視していた。延熙十三年、涪陵の徐巨の乱が平定された後、龐宏は危急の折に命を受け、民を宣撫し、豪族を厳しく取り締まり、清廉潔白な治政を行って大いに民心を得た。延熙十七年の夏、漢復県を巡察して民の事案を裁決し、帰途の烏江洪渡鎮で暴風に遭って船が転覆し、公務中に殉職した。追諡も手厚い葬礼もなく、その死後は寂しいものであった。","kr":"촉나라의 신하이자 방통의 아들로, 관직은 부릉태수에 이르렀다. 방굉은 부친의 재능을 이어받아 성격이 강직하고 솔직하며 권세를 두려워하지 않았다. 인물 품평을 즐겨 상서령 진지를 자주 멸시했다. 연희 13년, 부릉에서 서거의 반란이 평정된 후 방굉은 위태로운 시기에 명을 받아 백성을 선무하고 호족을 엄히 다스렸으며, 정치를 청렴하게 펼쳐 크게 민심을 얻었다. 연희 17년 여름, 한복현을 순시하며 백성의 송사를 처리하고 돌아오던 길에 오강 홍도진에서 폭풍을 만나 배가 전복되어 공무 중 순직했다. 시호도 추증받지 못하고 후한 장례도 치러지지 않아 사후가 쓸쓸했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1013602","remark":"","surname":"庞","surnameTc":"龐","surnameEn":"Pang","surnameJp":"龐","surnameKr":"방","surnameOther":"","name":"宏","nameTc":"宏","nameEn":"Hong","nameJp":"宏","nameKr":"굉","nameOther":"","word":"巨师","wordTc":"巨師","wordEn":"Jushi","wordJp":"巨師","wordKr":"거사","wordOther":"","icon":"庞宏","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"217","city":"CS1039","gender":"0","rule":"67","force":"52","wise":"81","politics":"76","charm":"70","will":"78","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"5","wiseTalent":"11","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"14/14/14/14/14/82/28/14","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1004105;1005105","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1019605","debateSoul":"1001205","warSoulPoint":"4400","battleSoulPoint":"1500","debateSoulPoint":"6500","strategy":"1001415","strategy2":"1000805","professions":"